{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ada","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Ada","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ada (.adb .ads .ada .gpr).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ada","name":"Ada","extensions":[".adb",".ads",".ada",".gpr"],"grammar":"grammars/ada.json","lineComment":"--"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Ada","path":"snippets/ada.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ada.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'[^'\\\\\\\\]'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:synchronized|overriding|exception|interface|procedure|protected|terminate|abstract|constant|function|separate|aliased|declare|generic|limited|package|private|renames|requeue|reverse|subtype|accept|access|digits|others|pragma|record|return|select|tagged|abort|array|begin|delay|delta|elsif|entry|raise|range|until|while|body|case|else|exit|goto|loop|null|some|task|then|type|when|with|abs|all|and|end|for|mod|new|not|out|rem|use|xor|at|do|if|in|is|of|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Long_Integer|Wide_String|Character|Positive|Duration|Integer|Natural|Boolean|String|Float)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Put_Line|Get_Line|New_Line|Put|Get)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ada.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Procedure\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"procedure ${1:Name} is\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"   $0\",\n      \"end ${1:Name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A procedure\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"func\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:Name} (${2:X} : ${3:Integer}) return ${4:Integer} is\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"   return $0;\",\n      \"end ${1:Name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Main program\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"procedure ${1:Main} is\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"   Put_Line (\\\"${2:Hello}\\\");\",\n      \"end ${1:Main};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A main procedure\"\n  },\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if ${1:condition} then\",\n      \"   $0\",\n      \"end if;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Ada\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ada.\n\n## Files\n\n`.adb`, `.ads`, `.ada`, `.gpr`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `proc` | A procedure |\n| `func` | A function |\n| `main` | A main procedure |\n| `if` | if |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}